// `Act x … Except under a₁, a₂`: performing `x` is lawful when and only when it is also a valid, enabled exercise of a named act sharing its components.
Fact actor Identified by Alice, Bob
Fact warrant Identified by W
Act search Actor actor Recipient actor' Except under search-with-warrant
Act search-with-warrant Actor actor Recipient actor' Holds when warrant(W).
?!lawful search(Alice, Bob).
+warrant(W).
?lawful search(Alice, Bob).
-warrant(W).
?!lawful search(Alice, Bob).
